## Proposed Changes

### [Contact Component]
#### [MODIFY] [ContactInfo.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/contact/ContactInfo.tsx)
- Apply persistent **inset** shadows to the contact cards.
- Remove hover translation and movement.
- Remove icon animations.
- Only change icon/text color on hover.
- Ensure backround consistency with the section (`bg-[#FAF9F6]`).

## Verification Plan

